secubox-crowdsec (1.0.7-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Fix (#498) : sudoers.d/secubox-crowdsec gains the 5 read-only cscli
    commands the /status + /console/status endpoints need. Without
    them the CrowdSec dashboard showed permanent 'CAPI Not enrolled'
    + 'LAPI not reachable' even after a successful
    `cscli console enroll …` because every `sudo cscli capi status`
    spawned by the FastAPI failed silently (no NOPASSWD entry → sudo
    prompted for a password → returncode != 0 → status = false).
    Added : cscli lapi status, cscli capi status, cscli decisions
    list, cscli alerts list, cscli console status.

